{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "id": "msg_011Ch1ogJ2w6vkMUVJ3EQA9X", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "I signed off after covering the shop and the quest log, but I'm not confident the build is clean. I filed two reports, and the developer replied \"could not reproduce with the steps given\" to both. Neither is confirmed.\n\n**Reported (both unconfirmed):**\n- **Sell Old Gear:** the list included Mithril Med Helmet (437 coins) but left out Steel Full Helmet (218 coins). I expected the lower-tier Steel helmet to be the outdated one. Agility Cape and Mercantile Cape were also listed as old gear.\n- **Mining Guild quests:** Iron Quota is a completed quest, but its row showed a lock and \"Requires Guild Level 1\" instead of \"Completed\". Copper Run showed Completed correctly.\n\n**Checked and looked fine:**\n- The Keep one of each item toggle stayed on after I left the shop and came back.\n- Hide completed worked in the quest log.\n- The Sell Junk list matched its total (953 coins). It left out Copper Ore, Tin Ore, Stone and Logs.\n\n**Not checked:**\n- I only opened and cancelled the Sell Junk and Sell Old Gear sheets, so I never confirmed that either sale actually runs.\n- I didn't check the Fishing Guild, so Shrimp Haul went unchecked.\n- I couldn't tell whether Feather and Cowhide count as unused materials, because the Fletching recipes I saw didn't list them.\n- Rotation and the Combat tab went untested."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 442, "cache_read_input_tokens": 75495, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 442}, "output_tokens": 497, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id":